Bragd is a desktop app for playing, studying and keeping board games:
chess and its variants, xiangqi and janggi, shogi, go, draughts, tafl,
backgammon, ur and senet. It plays against engines installed on the
system, analyses positions, keeps games in SQLite libraries, and plays
online. Calls with friends are off here: the packaged WebKitGTK has no
WebRTC.
